{"root":{"data":{"id":"dlppwa6rdiw0","created":1790473533685,"text":"心血管药理","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlptv9z0z8o0","created":1790484739292,"text":"抗心律失常药\nAntiarrhythmic Drugs","layout":null,"image":"","imageTitle":"","imageSize":"","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlptvezb00g0","created":1790484750193,"text":"心律失常发生的电生理机制","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlptvjnfwqw0","created":1790484760360,"text":"心律失常：心脏冲动、传导或者激动次序发生异常，\n引起心跳频率或节律发生紊乱","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlptvuwdfyo0","created":1790484784844,"text":"心肌细胞电生理学基础","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlptw33jyp40","created":1790484802693,"text":"心脏电活动的离子基础：\nNa+、K+、Ca2+的跨膜转运","layout":null,"hyperlink":"https://p.cldisk.com/star4/193fb34150a67c669455f3cd07b8654f/origin.png","hyperlinkTitle":"","note":"https://p.cldisk.com/star4/ff98416e79649d70d4c1b3c5593ad807/origin.png","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlptwa14uwo0","created":1790484817784,"text":"兴奋期与不应期","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlptwbxyme80","created":1790484821946,"text":"动作电位时程APD","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlptwjsypwg0","created":1790484839058,"text":"从动作电位去极化起始，\n到复极化回到静息电位水平的总时间","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlptwqd6c3s0","created":1790484853341,"text":"绝对不应期ARP","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlptwt1d16o0","created":1790484859157,"text":"钠通道完全处于失活状态，\n无法再次开放","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlptwwlztuo0","created":1790484866935,"text":"有效不应期ERP","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlptx1jgjlc0","created":1790484877665,"text":"足够强刺激也只能产生局部电位，\n不能产生可传导的动作电位","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlptxbpmdpc0","created":1790484899806,"text":"大部分 Na⁺通道仍处于失活状态，仅少量恢复，\n不足以形成再生性去极化。","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlptxkfxqko0","created":1790484918811,"text":"相对不应期RRP","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlptxn7914w0","created":1790484924816,"text":"ERP 结束后，膜电位从 - 60mV 恢复至静息电位\n（约 - 80 ~ -90mV）的阶段","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlptxv0uwl40","created":1790484941844,"text":"部分钠通道已经复活，\n但还没有全部回到备用状态","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlpty7cvr7k0","created":1790484968692,"text":"发生机制","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlptyew9c2g0","created":1790484985101,"text":"自律性升高","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlptyhehk5s0","created":1790484990557,"text":"自律细胞自律性升高","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlptyk63tgg0","created":1790484996581,"text":"交感活性增加","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlptylseh940","created":1790485000106,"text":"低血钾","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlptysa2zug0","created":1790485014236,"text":"心肌细胞受到机械牵张","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlptyxsfdzc0","created":1790485026229,"text":"非自律细胞异常自律性","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlptz3k809s0","created":1790485038793,"text":"缺血缺氧可使非自律心肌细胞出现异常自律性，这种异常兴奋向周围组织扩布可引起心律失常","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlptz7twk4g0","created":1790485048086,"text":"后除极：动作电位复极时\n产生的一个提前除极","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlptzf9g2cg0","created":1790485064263,"text":"早后除极EAD","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlpueng9b8o0","created":1790486257552,"text":"由APD过度延长引起","hyperlink":null,"hyperlinkTitle":null,"layout":null,"image":"https://p.cldisk.com/star4/0f8a7e68b3c87a54e57a213d3f0e27cb/origin.png","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":200,"height":115}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlpuesptcds0","created":1790486269013,"text":"所致心律失常以尖端扭转型室性心动过速常见","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlptzgjwviw0","created":1790485067073,"text":"迟后除极DAD","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlpwmthayco0","created":1790492539809,"text":"细胞内Ca2+超载引起","hyperlink":null,"hyperlinkTitle":null,"layout":null,"image":"https://p.cldisk.com/star4/5cf856243c617f9377c44bc1544708b4/origin.png","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":200,"height":97}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlpwnbz02k00","created":1790492580061,"text":"强心苷中毒，心肌缺氧，细胞外高钙是诱发因素","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlpwnjhain40","created":1790492596404,"text":"折返reentry:\n引发快速型心律失常的重要机制","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlpwo25jrk00","created":1790492637053,"text":"一次冲动下传后，又沿另一环形通路折回，\n再次兴奋已兴奋过的心肌","hyperlink":null,"hyperlinkTitle":null,"layout":null,"image":"https://p.cldisk.com/star4/222db489a6836e860fec608f6ff29084/origin.png","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":200,"height":96},"expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlpwoepmfsw0","created":1790492664388,"text":"折返形成的条件","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlpwolth4ps0","created":1790492679859,"text":"存在并行的2条通路","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlpwopmbiyo0","created":1790492688133,"text":"单向传导阻滞","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlpwouiy6680","created":1790492698813,"text":"冲动落在已兴奋细胞的不应期外","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlpwp103fig0","created":1790492712911,"text":"心内膜下缺血、预激综合征","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlpwvkowx3k0","created":1790493225955,"text":"功能性折返","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlpwvqyndlk0","created":1790493239605,"text":"正常心肌与缺血心肌之间形成功能性折返环","note":"https://p.cldisk.com/star4/e7ad2482b7005a3b5ffafe133712ab86/origin.png\n## 房室结双径路折返（AV node Reentry，房室结内折返性心动过速 AVNRT）\n\n1. **基础状态（窦性心律 Normal Sinus Rhythm）**：房室结存在两条传导径路\n   - fast 径（快径）：传导**速度快，有效不应期 ERP 长**\n   - slow 径（慢径）：传导**速度慢，有效不应期 ERP 短**\n2. **期前早搏 Premature beat**到来（图 1）：\n早搏到达房室结时，**快径尚处在 ERP（有效不应期，灰色区），不能下传（单向阻滞）；慢径不应期已恢复，可以缓慢下传**。\n3. 激动经慢径缓慢下传心室（图 2）；在激动下传的这段时间，**原来阻滞的快径已经脱离不应期**。\n4. 激动可以从心室侧沿**快径逆传回到心房**，再次激动心房；之后又可再次经慢径下传，**形成持续环形折返环路（图 3），诱发房室结折返性室上速**。\n\n> \n> 折返发生 3 个必要条件：\n> ① 两条功能上分离的传导通路；② 其中一条发生**单向传导阻滞**；③ 另一条通路传导**足够缓慢**，使原先阻滞的通路恢复兴奋性。\n\n---\n\n## 下方框图：折返的临床分型\n\n1. **心房折返 Atrial Re-entry**\n房速、心房扑动、心房颤动\n2. **房室结内折返 Atrio-Ventricular Nodal Re-entry**\n→ 室上速（AVNRT，最常见室上速之一）\n3. **房室折返 Atrio-Ventricular Re-entry**\n预激综合征（WPW，存在房室旁路）→ 室上速\n4. **心室折返 Ventricular Re-entry**\n→ 室性心动过速（心梗缺血区最常见，就是图左侧正常 / 缺血心肌之间的功能性折返）","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlpwxebvrug0","created":1790493368835,"text":"常见的心律失常类型","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlpwxn7vznc0","created":1790493388184,"text":"正位自律细胞—窦房结自律细胞","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlpwz5fw82o0","created":1790493506215,"text":"窦性心动过缓","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlpwz9ce7ts0","created":1790493514710,"text":"窦性心动过速","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlpwy30cpsw0","created":1790493422557,"text":"异位（潜在）自律细胞自律性异常","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlpwyrf35e80","created":1790493475691,"text":"窦上性心律失常","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlpwzfkpvy80","created":1790493528274,"text":"心房颤动","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlpwzoavfso0","created":1790493547270,"text":"心房扑动","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlpwzui0qls0","created":1790493560763,"text":"室性心律失常","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlpx02xot3s0","created":1790493579125,"text":"室性早搏","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlpx0423r6o0","created":1790493581568,"text":"室性心动过速","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlpx0ab3dog0","created":1790493595173,"text":"心室颤动","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlptzo79dc80","created":1790485083