"text":"药理作用：\n抑制激活态/失活态L型钙通道，也抑制钾通道","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlqjlqsaxhs0","created":1790557341107,"text":"自律性","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlqjlvtkdnc0","created":1790557352067,"text":"降低窦房结自律性","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlqjlzoyubk0","created":1790557360496,"text":"降低心房肌、心室肌、PF的异常自律性","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlqjlsd0ed40","created":1790557344536,"text":"传导性","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlqjm8h1azk0","created":1790557379608,"text":"减慢窦房结、房室结传导性","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlqjmh1in940","created":1790557398261,"text":"防止心室率加快","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlqjltlqk4w0","created":1790557347240,"text":"不应期","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlqjmm5tv0o0","created":1790557409405,"text":"延长窦房结、房室结ERP","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlqjkxj9tvc0","created":1790557277434,"text":"临床应用","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlqjn7hsvy00","created":1790557455842,"text":"折返引起的室上性心律失常","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlqjndb3xsw0","created":1790557468498,"text":"阵发性室上性心动过速——维拉帕米","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlqjnkwzx7k0","created":1790557485059,"text":"降低房扑、房颤患者的心室率","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlqjl1blgio0","created":1790557285677,"text":"注意事项","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlqjo5cfmgo0","created":1790557529528,"text":"窦房结疾病、房室阻滞及严重心功能不全者应该慎用或禁用","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlqjoizij6o0","created":1790557559221,"text":"维拉帕米一般不与β受体阻断药合用","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlqjph2z9rc0","created":1790557633441,"text":"二者负性频率、负性传导、负性肌力作用协同增强，\n合用可引发严重心动过缓、房室传导阻滞、低血压\n甚至心衰，因此一般不联合使用","layout":nul